{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Temporal.Duration</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"hegel","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Hegel","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Generators","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Temporal","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Duration","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Signed durations.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-t.seconds\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.seconds\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>seconds : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.nanoseconds\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.nanoseconds\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>nanoseconds : int;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>A signed duration: <code>seconds</code> plus <code>nanoseconds</code> of the same sign, the latter within <code>±999999999</code>, so -1.5 s is <code>{ seconds = -1; nanoseconds = -500_000_000 }</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-min_value\"><a href=\"#val-min_value\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> min_value : <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The lowest duration, <code>-max_int</code> seconds and <code>-999999999</code> nanoseconds.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-max_value\"><a href=\"#val-max_value\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> max_value : <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div cl