"spec-doc\"><p><code>equal a b</code> returns whether <code>a</code> and <code>b</code> have the same fields.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compare\"><a href=\"#val-compare\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compare : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>compare a b</code> orders valid durations from the most negative up.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-hegel_generator\"><a href=\"#val-hegel_generator\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> hegel_generator : <span><span>(<a href=\"#type-t\">t</a>, <a href=\"../../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>durations ()</code>, every duration.</p></div></div>"}